  "new": "Transport decided in ADR-0004 (kernel-owned registry; subscribe is per block: subscribe(class, block_id, handler, name)); Open Question 8 resolved, acceptance gated on KRN-LAT-02."
 },
 {
  "file": "design/gdd/command-simulation-layer.md (Notifications AC ~L1014)",
