  "new": "subscribing as INPUT_SURFACE confers no submit right (ADR-0002 registry presentation_submit_without_handle); the SurfaceHandle is issued separately by the composition root. Keep: a subscribe by an object that owns a block or hook is refused (SUBSCRIBE_REFUSED), which ADR-0003's closed violation set must now include."
 },
 {
  "file": "design/gdd/command-simulation-layer.md (D.12, L597) - CONDITIONAL on ADR-0005 adopting the touch serial",
